<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>The following Macro file allows you to perform the enchantment either for armor or weapons in quantities. Allowing you to speed up time when combining with the lucky fortune cubes.

You just have to open your inventory (leave it as is in the default position).y you may have to adjust the inventory to the cursor selection. The inventory to be enchanted must also be organized as follows:

Knowing that the inventory is 9 columns per row:
In the first row, first column, the cube to be entered will be located.
Starting from the second row, the armor or weapons that will be enchanted will be located.
Finally, to start executing the macro, you must open the enchantment window and start the program
You can modify the number of times you want it to stay in the loop.</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
